    <briefdescription>
<para>Builds a variant-access projection field: a struct field that replaces a VARIANT column in the read schema so that, instead of the full variant, only the described paths are extracted at read time (reading only the required shredded sub-columns from shredded files). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Example: read <computeroutput>$.age</computeroutput> as INT64 and <computeroutput>$.city</computeroutput> as STRING from variant column <computeroutput>v</computeroutput>: <verbatim>VariantAccessBuilder builder;
builder.AddField(age_type, &quot;$.age&quot;);
builder.AddField(city_type, &quot;$.city&quot;);
auto field = builder.Build(&quot;v&quot;);  // use in ReadContextBuilder::SetReadSchema
</verbatim> The resulting struct has one child per added field, named by its position (&quot;0&quot;, &quot;1&quot;, ...). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
